Four [[Seer Storage Chest]]s can be found in [[The Last Vault]] of the [[Lost Basilica]]. They become accessible after the [[The Basilica Vaults]] [[meta event]]. Each chest can be opened once per day per account.

== Locations ==
;[[Castora]]
* [[Starlit Weald]]
** [[Lost Basilica]]

== Contents ==
* {{gather|Piece of Common Unidentified Gear|qty=1|chance=guaranteed}} <small>(or better)</small>
* Chance for an additional {{gather|Piece of Rare Unidentified Gear|chance=chance}}
* Additionally with {{effect|Obscured Riches}} mastery:
** {{gather|Raw Enchanting Stone|qty=1|notes=requires [[Obscured Riches]] mastery|chance=guaranteed}}
** {{gather|Unusual Coin|qty=1-3|notes=requires [[Obscured Riches]] mastery|chance=guaranteed}}
** Chance for:
*** {{gather|Piece of Unidentified Gear|qty=1-2|chance=guaranteed}} <small>(or better)</small>
*** Chance for an additional {{gather|Piece of Rare Unidentified Gear|chance=chance}}
* Any gear drop may be replaced by a {{gather|Chromatic Resin Box|chance=chance}}
* Chance for {{gather|Extremis Token: Helmet|chance=chance}}

